<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 safe-area-x">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <%!-- Base viewport. JS below adds maximum-scale=1 on iOS only to
         prevent auto-zoom on input focus. iOS ignores it for pinch-zoom
         (safe). Android respects it (blocks pinch-zoom = bad), so we
         only set it where it's needed. --%>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <script>
      if (/iPhone|iPad|iPod/.test(navigator.userAgent)) {
        document.querySelector('meta[name=viewport]').setAttribute('content',
          'width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover');
      }
    </script>
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
    <meta name="csrf-token" content={get_csrf_token()} />
    <title>
      Loopyard - An open-source multiplayer software factory where humans and AI ship code together.
    </title>
    <link phx-track-static rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/app.css"} />
    <script defer phx-track-static type="text/javascript" src={~p"/assets/app.js"}>
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="h-full antialiased font-sans">
    <%!-- Connection-lost banner. Hidden by default; the LiveSocket lifecycle in
    app.js reveals it when the websocket has been down past a short grace period,
    so you always know when a send won't go through (the input also holds the text
    until the server acks — see the ChatForm hook). --%>
    <div
      id="conn-banner"
      class="hidden fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-amber-500 text-amber-950 text-sm font-medium px-4 py-1.5 shadow-md"
    >
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-900 animate-pulse"></span>
      Connection lost — reconnecting. Messages you send will wait until it's back.
    </div>
    <a
      href="#main-content"
      class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-2 focus:left-2 focus:z-50 focus:bg-violet-600 focus:text-white focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:rounded-md focus:font-medium"
    >
      Skip to main content
    </a>
    <%!-- Ambient audio — the "room tone" of Loopyard. Lives in the root layout
         (outside {@inner_content}) and the whole app runs in one live_session,
         so this element is mounted once and the bed keeps playing across every
         navigation. Off by default (browsers block autoplay without a gesture);
         the corner toggle starts it. The AmbientAudio hook owns play/pause/
         volume and remembers the choice in localStorage. The bed streams from
         the `activity` channel, which ActivitySound already drives from live
         agent events. --%>
    <div id="ambient" phx-hook="AmbientAudio" data-channel="activity">
      <audio id="ambient-el" preload="none"></audio>
      <button
        id="ambient-toggle"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Toggle ambient sound"
        aria-pressed="false"
        title="Ambient sound"
        class="fixed bottom-3 left-3 z-40 inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-zinc-900/60 dark:bg-white/10 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white backdrop-blur border border-white/10 shadow-lg transition-colors"
      >
        <svg
          data-ambient-icon="off"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          fill="currentColor"
          class="w-4 h-4"
        >
          <path d="M10 3.75a.75.75 0 0 0-1.264-.546L5.203 6.5H3.667A1.667 1.667 0 0 0 2 8.167v3.666A1.667 1.667 0 0 0 3.667 13.5h1.536l3.533 3.296A.75.75 0 0 0 10 16.25V3.75Z" />
          <path d="M14.78 7.72a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L14.94 10l-1.22 1.22a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06 1.06L16 11.06l1.22 1.22a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06-1.06L17.06 10l1.22-1.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06-1.06L16 8.94l-1.22-1.22Z" />
        </svg>
        <svg
          data-ambient-icon="on"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          fill="currentColor"
          class="w-4 h-4 hidden"
        >
          <path d="M10 3.75a.75.75 0 0 0-1.264-.546L5.203 6.5H3.667A1.667 1.667 0 0 0 2 8.167v3.666A1.667 1.667 0 0 0 3.667 13.5h1.536l3.533 3.296A.75.75 0 0 0 10 16.25V3.75Z" />
          <path d="M14.657 3.879a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06 7 7 0 0 1 0 9.9.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.061 8.5 8.5 0 0 0 0-12.021Z" />
          <path d="M12.182 6.354a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 4.95.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06 5 5 0 0 0 0-7.07Z" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    {@inner_content}
  </body>
</html>
